<div class="page-head"><div><a class="back-link" href="/accounting">‹ Money</a><p class="eyebrow">Liability, not revenue</p><h1>Sales-tax records</h1><p class="lede">Foundry preserves tax amounts from authoritative commerce records and can calculate invoice tax from a configured rate. It does not file or remit taxes.</p></div></div>
<div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><span>Collected / payable</span><strong><%= helpers.money(payableMinor, currency) %></strong></div><div class="stat"><span>Recoverable on purchases</span><strong><%= helpers.money(recoverableMinor, currency) %></strong></div><div class="stat"><span>Net recorded liability</span><strong><%= helpers.money(payableMinor - recoverableMinor, currency) %></strong></div></div>
<section class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Configured rates and jurisdictions</h2><p class="hint">Rates are dated evidence for calculations; connected systems' exact tax amounts remain authoritative.</p></div></div><div class="card-body"><% if(!rates.length){ %><div class="empty"><strong>No tax rates configured.</strong><p>You can still enter or import an exact tax amount.</p></div><% } else { %><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Rate</th><th>Applies to</th><th>Effective</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rates.forEach(function(rate){ %><tr><td><%= rate.name %></td><td><%= rate.jurisdiction %></td><td><%= (rate.rate_millionths / 10000).toFixed(4).replace(/0+$/,'').replace(/\.$/,'') %>%</td><td><%= rate.applies_to.toLowerCase() %></td><td><%= rate.effective_from %><%= rate.effective_to ? ` – ${rate.effective_to}` : '' %></td><td><%= rate.active ? 'Active' : 'Inactive' %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% } %></div></section>
<details class="card"><summary class="card-head"><div><h2>Add a dated tax rate</h2><p class="hint">Owner or accountant only.</p></div></summary><form class="card-body grid grid--3" method="post" action="/accounting/tax/rates"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Rate name</span><input class="input" name="name" required placeholder="State and local sales tax"></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Jurisdiction</span><input class="input" name="jurisdiction" required placeholder="State / county / city"></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Rate percent</span><input class="input" name="ratePercent" inputmode="decimal" required placeholder="8.875"></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Applies to</span><select class="select" name="appliesTo"><option value="SALES">Sales</option><option value="PURCHASES">Purchases</option><option value="BOTH">Both</option></select></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Effective from</span><input class="input" type="date" name="effectiveFrom" value="<%= today %>" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Effective through (optional)</span><input class="input" type="date" name="effectiveTo"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Save tax rate</button></form></details>
